# This repo (zepruv/.github) supplies the reusable CI/CD workflows every Zepruv service pipeline calls via
# `uses: zepruv/.github/.github/workflows/<file>.yml@main`, plus the shared composite actions and helper scripts
# those workflows run on deploy. A change here takes effect for every consuming service's very next CI run,
# with no separate review gate on the consumer side - so review of changes to it is concentrated on one owner
# rather than left open to anyone with write access.
#
# This file only has teeth once branch protection on `main` has "Require review from Code Owners" enabled
# (Settings > Branches > Branch protection rules > main), in addition to the existing required-approvals rule.
# Patterns follow .gitignore syntax; the LAST matching pattern for a given file wins, so more specific rules
# belong below broader ones.

# Default: everything in this repo needs the infra owner's review.
*                       @dinesh776

# Called by every service's CI/CD - the highest-blast-radius paths.
/.github/workflows/     @dinesh776
/.github/actions/       @dinesh776
/scripts/               @dinesh776
